 ('02',['32-09','32-10'],'hund scēapa; nigon and hundnigontig; ān of ðǣm','a hundred sheep; ninety-nine; one of those. Supply the numerical expressions and the partitive of phrase; prior numeral citations do not grant general production.'),
 ('03',['33-01'],'mid Marian his mēder','with Mary his mother. Marian is a supplied weak-feminine local treatment, distinct from the prior genitive source record.'),
 ('04',['33-02','33-03'],'Egypta land / tō Egypta lande / of Egyptum','land of the Egyptians / to their land / from the Egyptians. Supply the foreign-name forms and explain their place-reference function; no singular or fictional complete ethnic paradigm.'),
