 ('12',['36-02','36-03','36-04'],'ðēos','this woman: feminine personal reference follows the woman’s natural gender although the previously used noun wīf is grammatically neuter. The exact reference is supplied, not tested as an unannounced general gender rule.'),
 ('13',['36-02'],'wæter tō mīnum fōtum','water for my feet: the purpose of washing/caring for the body part is supplied; tō does not mean motion toward a destination here.'),
